      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Judging by the logs I'm getting, this may be the underlying cause for another issue:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/world-soft-crashing-on-player-leave-duel-world\n\n@{5b2abf053c15f95a7c85c1ae|full_name} Could you point to where you're destroying the object multiple times?\nEdit: nvm I asked that before looking at how comprehensive the world is xD I'll test this to see if this is similar to the above issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5b616a262fa9017c9b3ee9ac",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5a7ef34e0238de350e4dc63e",
        "alias": "Imperial red Raccoon",
        "aliasID": "65ba030aed6eefce4c1abc2d",
