      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a7ef34e0238de350e4dc63e|full_name}: I've discovered that creating an action that doesn't have a defined object for that action to effect causes the same issue. Something as simple as having a SetGameObjectActive and leaving it blank will achieve the same effect.",
