      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b2abf053c15f95a7c85c1ae|full_name}: Excellent find sir! And makes sense, already destroyed objects would be very similar to leaving it empty.\n\nUnfortunately it looks like I won't be able to avoid this bug though. Because having the master leave the instance causes an unspecified amount of objects to be destroyed outside of my control. Hoping it will help fix this fast :]",
